第1-2句 地点与危险:I am trapped in … The biggest danger is …
第3-4句 已做的行动:So far, I have …
第5句 下一步:Next, I will …
第6句 心情 + 让步从句:However hard this is, I refuse to give up. No matter what happens, I will keep calm and hopeful.', 2, 'elective2', 'U6', 'fltrp');

